}

### Me
GET {{host}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Workdays
GET {{host}}/api/workdays
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### My enrollments
GET {{host}}/api/me/enrollments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Admin users
GET {{host}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
